sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports security profile 3
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: 1. Execute Reusable State RenewChargingStationCertificate (With requestId)

    CS->>CSMS: 2. Disconnect current connection and reconnect with the new certificate
    CSMS-->>CS: 3. Accept incoming connection request using the new certificate

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validation: The Test System and the CSMS are connected
